    "text": "Element <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> forms ccp structure and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> occupies half of the octahedral voids, while oxygen atoms occupy all the tetrahedral voids. The structure of bimetallic oxide is:",
